	(gr_text "NOTES\n\n 1. PRINTED CIRCUIT BOARD MADE FROM NEMA GRADE FR-4 EPOXY LAMINATE.\n 2. ALL DIMENSIONS ARE GIVEN IN MILLIMETERS.\n 3. CIRCUIT PATHS ARE FOR REFERENCE ONLY.\n 4. HOLE SIZES SHOWN ARE FINISHED DIAMETERS AFTER PLATING.\n 5. APPLY GREEN SOLDER MASK ON PLATED SURFACES.\n 6. SILKSCREEN TOP AND BOTTOM SIDES USING WHITE INK.\n 7. ALL VIAS ARE TENTED ON BOTH SIDES.\n 8. 2 COPPER LAYERS.\n 9. 1.6MM BOARD THICKNESS.\n10. COPPER THICKNESS 1 OZ.\n\n\n    DESIGNED TO FIT 1551SFLxx ENCLOSURE."
